        "timestamp": 1775043829
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Joscha is working on the release of <code>v4.30.0-rc1</code> today (which will bring the grind canonicalizer change), so ideally we can have this PR delegated and/or merged by the time he gets to Mathlib.</p>",
